{
  "id": "overnight-04-locale-select",
  "exportName": "selectLocaleValue",
  "objective": "Implement pure exported selectLocaleValue(localeMap:unknown,locale:unknown):string|null. Require nonnull plain object (its Object.getPrototypeOf is null or equals Object.getPrototypeOf({})), not array, and nonempty locale string without surrounding whitespace; throw TypeError otherwise. Validate every own enumerable map value is string or null, even when requested key missing. Return exact requested own property string/null; absent returns null. Preserve empty/whitespace values. No normalization, locale list, inherited-property reads, editorial fallback, mutation/imports. Safely handle arbitrary keys. Generated source including comments must avoid forbidden identifiers import,require,process,globalThis,eval,Function,fetch,WebSocket,constructor,__proto__,prototype; no literal keys are needed.",
  "cases": [
    {
